  "content": "<p><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" alt=\"Exposure\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">胶片摄影模组</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_camera.png\" alt=\"Camera\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_film.png\" alt=\"Film\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_developing.png\" alt=\"Developing\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_printing.png\" alt=\"Printing\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_photograph.png\" alt=\"Photograph\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br></div>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_additional_features.png\" alt=\"Additional Features\" width=\"260\"></p>\n<div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_chromatic.png\" alt=\"Chromatic\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_projector.gif\" alt=\"Interplanar Projector\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure-polaroid\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_polaroid.png\" alt=\"Polaroid\" width=\"1000\"></a> <br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure-catalog\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_catalog.png\" alt=\"Catalog\" width=\"1000\"></a> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_negatives.png\" alt=\"Negatives\" width=\"1000\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HI9Bnjc9HYs\" width=\"1000\" height=\"380\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmoddedmc.wiki%252fen%252fproject%252fexposure%252flatest%252fdocs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/wiki.png\" alt=\"Wiki\" width=\"200\" height=\"62\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>已知不兼容项：</strong></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">- <strong>Optifine</strong> - 已知会导致与其他模组产生问题。请改用 Sodium/Embeddium。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">- <strong>Visual Overhaul</strong> - 打开相机控制界面时会崩溃 - <a href=\"https://github.com/mortuusars/Exposure/issues/19\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 问题报告</a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">- <strong>Exordium</strong> - 通过取景器观察时会出现问题和闪烁。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">- <strong>FastAnim</strong> (Fabric) - 使用相机时会破坏玩家模型动画。<a href=\"https://github.com/mortuusars/Exposure/issues/71\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 问题报告</a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">喜欢这个模组吗？您的支持将使我能够继续开发此模组及其他模组！</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars/membership\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon_seamless.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"558.73\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253d4VPMCBCLZVUEA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal_seamless.png\" alt=\"PayPal\" width=\"191.75\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars/posts/rewards-129739244\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_golden_camera.png\" alt=\"Golden Camera\" width=\"1000\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord Server\" width=\"550\" height=\"88\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">查看我的其他模组：</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/envelope\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/main.png\" alt=\"Envelope\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chalk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L5IBBEH.png\" alt=\"Chalk\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sooty-chimneys\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PHaFgV2.png\" alt=\"Sooty Chimneys\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wares\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tpmC8km.png\" alt=\"Wares\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monobank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Le5yWV.png\" alt=\"Monobank\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/thief/main.png\" alt=\"Thief\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/salt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NhbmXO8.png\" alt=\"Salt\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scholar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/scholar/main-512.png\" alt=\"Scholar\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horseman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/horseman/main.png\" alt=\"Horseman\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
